---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const aboutHref = `${base}/about/`;
const githubHref = 'https://github.com/iopanda';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="首页"
  description="iopanda 的个人站点：关于代码、工具与日常的安静角落。"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">
      <span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Personal site · 2026
    </p>
    <h1>写代码，<br /><span class="accent">也写点别的。</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      我是 iopanda。这里是我的数字角落，用来存放做过的项目、顺手写下的笔记，
      以及那些还没来得及整理成文章的想法。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href={aboutHref}>
        认识我 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a
        class="button button--ghost"
        href={githubHref}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="now-title">最近在做</h2>
      <span>Now</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <p class="card-index" aria-hidden="true">01</p>
        <h3>重建这个站点</h3>
        <p>从 Hexo 迁移到 Astro，去掉多余的依赖，把注意力留给内容本身。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <p class="card-index" aria-hidden="true">02</p>
        <h3>整理旧笔记</h3>
        <p>把散落在各处的想法收拢起来，慢慢补上那些迟到的说明文档。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--compact">
    <div class="note">
      <span class="note-label">近况</span>
      <p>
        正在学习如何把复杂的事情说简单。如果你也有同样的兴趣，欢迎到
        <a href={githubHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        找我。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
